# Sandcastle runtime output at repo root (logs/, worktrees/, .env) — created
# here because run()'s `cwd` option anchors these to the repo root, even
# though the source config (blocks.json, Dockerfile, prompt files) lives in
# the tracked app/.sandcastle/. Leading slash: don't also match app/.sandcastle/.
/.sandcastle/
